1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,903
This tutorial adds a tenant, invites them
to

2
00:00:02,903 --> 00:00:05,806
the tenant portal, and later withdraws
that access.

3
00:00:05,806 --> 00:00:08,709
As a Company Admin, open Leasing, then
Tenants.

4
00:00:08,709 --> 00:00:10,886
A tenant profile holds the person's

5
00:00:10,886 --> 00:00:13,063
names, contact details, and preferred
language.

6
00:00:13,063 --> 00:00:15,241
Before adding someone, search for them.

7
00:00:15,241 --> 00:00:18,507
No tenants match Mariam, so there is no
duplicate.

8
00:00:18,507 --> 00:00:19,595
Select Add Tenant.

9
00:00:19,595 --> 00:00:23,587
Enter the English name, Mariam Al Nuaimi,
and the Arabic name.

10
00:00:23,587 --> 00:00:27,215
Enter her email address and mobile number,
and check them

11
00:00:27,215 --> 00:00:30,481
carefully, because the portal invitation
goes to that email.

12
00:00:30,481 --> 00:00:32,659
They are hidden in this video.

13
00:00:32,659 --> 00:00:34,836
Choose Arabic as the preferred language.

14
00:00:34,836 --> 00:00:37,376
Create Portal Account is ticked, so Miftah

15
00:00:37,376 --> 00:00:39,916
will invite her to the tenant portal.

16
00:00:39,916 --> 00:00:40,642
Select Create.

17
00:00:40,642 --> 00:00:43,182
The confirmation says an invite was
emailed.

18
00:00:43,182 --> 00:00:46,811
The link lets her set her own password, so
no

19
00:00:46,811 --> 00:00:50,077
password is shown to you or shared by
anyone.

20
00:00:50,077 --> 00:00:50,802
Select Done.

21
00:00:50,802 --> 00:00:55,157
Mariam joins the list with Arabic as her
language, and Resend invite

22
00:00:55,157 --> 00:00:59,511
is there in case the email goes astray or
the link expires.

23
00:00:59,511 --> 00:01:01,688
Select View to open her page.

24
00:01:01,688 --> 00:01:04,591
Invite pending stays until she sets her
password.

25
00:01:04,591 --> 00:01:07,132
Her contracts, cheques, and tickets will
collect

26
00:01:07,132 --> 00:01:09,672
here, and Ledger opens her account
statement.

27
00:01:09,672 --> 00:01:11,486
For now there are none.

28
00:01:11,486 --> 00:01:15,115
Portal access is a user account with the
Tenant role.

29
00:01:15,115 --> 00:01:18,743
If a tenant should no longer sign in, for
example

30
00:01:18,743 --> 00:01:22,372
after they move out, remove the account,
not the tenant.

31
00:01:22,372 --> 00:01:26,001
Open Settings, then Users and staff, and
search for Mariam.

32
00:01:26,001 --> 00:01:28,178
Her account shows the role Tenant.

33
00:01:28,178 --> 00:01:30,355
Select Delete, then confirm Delete User.

34
00:01:30,355 --> 00:01:33,984
Back on her tenant page, Invite pending
and Resend invite

35
00:01:33,984 --> 00:01:37,250
are gone, because she no longer has a
sign-in.

36
00:01:37,250 --> 00:01:40,153
Her profile stays, and so does her
history.

37
00:01:40,153 --> 00:01:43,056
Never reuse one tenant's account for
another person.
